    "title": "Woman Shot Near Duryea Elementary School - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ethan Buchanan ,\n8 hours ago According to Harris County Sheriff Ed Gonzalez, a woman has been shot near the 6700 block of Rusty Ridge Lane, not far from Cy-Fair ISD's Duryea Elementary School.\nDetails are limited at this time, but Sheriff Gonzalez says the alleged shooter remained on the scene.\nOur TV partner Channel 2 reports that homicide investigators have been called to the scene.",
